<final>


The contract contains a critical vulnerability where the withdrawal function is completely unprotected, allowing any user to drain the pension fund.

### Vulnerability: Unchecked Payment Receiver
### Explanation: The withdrawal handler uses `Gtxn[1].accounts[1]` as the payment receiver without any validation, allowing any address to be specified. Combined with the fact that this handler is triggered by ClearState (which can be called by anyone), this enables complete fund drainage by any attacker.
### Risk: Critical - Complete loss of all funds in the pension contract
